    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7580cec4_33101f42",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_protocol.c",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 1776,
      "author": {
        "id": 1103909
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-10-27T16:00:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "250us seems really fast. I\u0027m not even sure we can transmit the whole packet in this amount of time, and if there is a collision and retry, we don\u0027t have a chance.\n\nWhen we send this command, do we get a response, or just goodCRC? If we just get goodCRC, then we can change the statement to, if (pd[0].vdm_state !\u003d VDM_STATE_READY) to make it faster, since the normal vdm state machine always expects a response and will timeout on these.",
      "parentUuid": "7580cec4_5de60cc2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1776,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 1776,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "6ecad9c261c244674817815b7df5538935f8683d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f52f5eb3_e5e730e7",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_protocol.c",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 1776,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000016
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-10-27T21:56:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "250 us is indeed shorter than a message with 2 words in the payload.\nwe are going to get the GoodCRC+the VDM ACK I imagine.",
      "parentUuid": "7580cec4_33101f42",
      "revId": "6ecad9c261c244674817815b7df5538935f8683d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "35cf3649_357fb24f",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_protocol.c",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 1776,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000256
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-10-28T01:16:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed ... too fast.  Doing the math on above 2 VDO packet is:\n\n               2 VDOs ---v\n  (64 + 4*5 + 16 * 5/4 + 2 * 32 * 5/4 + 32 * 5/4 + 5)/3bits_per_msec \u003d 76.3ms\n\n\n\nchanging to 100*MSEC\n\nWe do get an ack via the command type so we can\u0027t optimize for the goodCRC case unfortunately.",
      "parentUuid": "7580cec4_33101f42",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1776,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 1776,
        "endChar": 21
      },
